meta {
  name: Delete card
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/cards/9
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  If-Match: {{cardEtag}}
}

docs {
  Seed data has cards 1-8; run "Create card" first to have a card 9,
  then "Get card" (adjust the id) to capture its ETag.
  Deleting a card removes its grading certificate as well.
  The If-Match header is required (428 without it, 412 when stale).
}
